SIL Open Font License (OFL) 1.1
================================

Opptrix ships the following fonts as bundled assets (npm @fontsource packages).
They are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

Fonts
-----
- Noto Sans SC — Copyright 2014–2026 Google Inc. (also used as Source Han Sans SC alias;
  Noto Sans CJK / Source Han Sans share the same open-source lineage)
- Inter — Copyright 2016–2020 The Inter Project Authors
- JetBrains Mono — Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors

Full license text: https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

You may use, study, modify and redistribute these fonts under OFL terms.
Font software may not be sold by itself. Reserved Font Names may not be used
by derivative works without written permission from the copyright holders.
